{"product_id":"zyn-nicotine-pouches-coffee-mini","title":"ZYN Nicotine Pouches - Coffee Mini","description":"\u003cp\u003eZYN Coffee Mini Strong delivers the rich, full-bodied taste of freshly brewed coffee with subtle notes of cocoa and toasted beans.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eZYN Coffee nicotine pouches don't produce smoke or vapour, so they're the best way to satisfy your nicotine cravings where vaping or smoking isn’t allowed. Available in 3mg (7.5mg\/g), 6mg (15mg\/g), 9.5mg (12.9mg\/g) and 11mg (14.9mg\/g) strengths per pouch, ZYN offer both light and medium levels of nicotine. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoffee Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mg, 6mg, 9.5mg \u0026amp; 11mg Strengths\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 x Mini Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"3 mg","offer_id":42197278162999,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Coffee Mini - 3 mg","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6 mg","offer_id":42197278294071,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Coffee Mini - 6 mg","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"11mg","offer_id":42030412464183,"sku":"ZYN Pouches - Coffee Mini - 11 mg","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/zyn_coffee_mini_nicotine_pouches_1.webp?v=1766445524","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/zyn-nicotine-pouches-coffee-mini","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




